  "SCHEDULED POWER INTERRUPTION: OCTOBER 20, 2026\nGinapahibalo sang Negros Power ang mga konsumidores nga may ara sang natalana nga power interruption sa October 20, 2026 (Tuesday).\nIni kabahin sang 5-year rehabilitation kag modernization plan sang Negros Power agud malikawan ang mga wala ginalauman kag mas lapnagon nga power interruptions kag mangin reliable ang distribution system sang aton elektrisidad.\nYari ang mga detalye sang scheduled power interruption:\nDate: October 20, 2026 (Tuesday)\nReason: Uprating of one 50kVa overloaded common distribution transformer into one 75kVa distribution transformer\nTime & Affected Areas:\n9:00AM to 1:00PM\nPortion of MF6 - Portion of Country Homes Subd., Brgy. Estefania,  Bacolod City.\nMadamo gid nga salamat sa inyo nga pag hangop.\n#NegrosPowerRehab\n#PadayonAngRehabilitasyon\n#ForBetterElectricService"
 ],
